oom 221</div><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Meeting Ref</span><br><code style=\"font-size:.75rem\">MIN-2015-07-7075</code></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><span style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;padding:.2rem .5rem;background:#dcfce7;color:#15803d;border:1px solid #86efac\">&#10003; QUORUM ESTABLISHED</span><span style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">4 of 7 members present</span></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Attendance</h5><table class=\"dash-table w-100\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Title</th><th>Role</th><th style=\"text-align:center\">Present</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Aysegul Parsons</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Director of Sales Strategy</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Employee Representative</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Moran Ramos</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Senior Analyst, Compensation</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Associate Director</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Weiwei Bhatt</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Director of Investor Relations</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Chief Human Resources Officer</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Mariam Woods</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Manager of Client Relations</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Bankruptcy Counsel (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr style=\"opacity:.5\"><td style=\"font-weight:400\">Laszlo Baker</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Grants Coordinator</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">IT Consultant (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ccc\">&mdash;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Agenda</h5><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 1</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Enterprise Risk Management Framework — Annual Assessment</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The committee discussed the Enterprise Risk Management Framework — Annual Assessment, a review of the company&#x27;s compliance with tort laws. The committee reviewed the company&#x27;s risk management practices and confirmed that they were in compliance.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To approve for talent attraction:</strong> RESOLVED, that the Employee Stock Plan Administration Committee approves the company&#x27;s response to the shareholder proposal regarding Enterprise Risk Management Framework — Annual Assessment.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Mariam Woods &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Weiwei Bhatt</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 4 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 2</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Regional Business Review: APAC</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The committee considered the Regional Business Review: APAC, a proposal to adopt a new policy on employee privacy. The policy was approved and will be implemented company-wide.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To approve for status:</strong> RESOLVED, that the Employee Stock Plan Administration Committee approves the selection of Giving Advisory Group as the vendor for the Regional Business Review: APAC and authorizes management to execute the final contract.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Mariam Woods &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Aysegul Parsons</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 3 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 1 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 3</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Conflict of Interest Disclosures</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The committee considered the Conflict of Interest Disclosures, a proposal to adopt a new policy on related-party transactions. The policy was approved and will be implemented company-wide.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To approve for exit:</strong> RESOLVED, that the Employee Stock Plan Administration Committee approves the grant of 149 performance share units to the executive team, subject to the performance conditions outlined in Exhibit C.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Aysegul Parsons &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Weiwei Bhatt</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 4 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 4</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Independent Director Session: Board Effectiveness</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The committee received an update on the Independent Director Session: Board Effectiveness from Laszlo Baker. The project is currently on schedule and under budget. The next major milestone is 2015-08-28. No committee action was required.</p></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Action Items</h5><table class=\"dash-table w-100\"><thead><tr><th style=\"width:2rem\">#</th><th>Description</th><th>Owner</th><th>Due</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">1</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Review the company&#x27;s data privacy policy for compliance with CPRA and GDPR</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Esra Karnik</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2015-08-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">2</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Review and update the company&#x27;s stock ownership guidelines</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Clive Falade</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2015-09-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">3</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Analyze the ROI of the company&#x27;s leadership development programs</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Ibeji Crowley</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2015-09-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">4</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Conduct a market analysis of executive compensation trends in the Boutique CPA Practices sector</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Lacey Cohen</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2015-09-28</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1rem 1.2rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:#333;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:.5rem\">There being no further business, a motion to adjourn was made and carried unanimously. Meeting adjourned at 12:45 PM CT.</p><p style=\"font-size:.83rem;margin-bottom:.75rem;color:#555\"><strong>Next meeting:</strong> 2015-08-21</p><div><p style=\"font-size:.78rem;color:#888;margin-bottom:.25rem\">Respectfully submitted,</p><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.1rem\">Laszlo Baker</p><p style=\"font-size:.78rem;color:#666;margin-bottom:.75rem\">Grants Coordinator, IT Consultant (External)</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:2rem\"><div><div style=\"width:160px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;margin-bottom:.2rem;height:1.5rem\"></div><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;color:#888\">Signature</div></div><div><div style=\"width:120px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;margin-bottom:.2rem;height:1.5rem\"></div><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;color:#888\">Approved: ___________</div></div></div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><a href=\"/archive/2015/07/02/iss-engagement-preparation-8786/\" style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\">&larr; Previous</a><a href=\"/archive/2015/07/03/executive-succession-memo-7789/sign-on-bonus-prevalence-benchmarking-3155/\" style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\">Next &rarr;</a></div></div><div class=\"col-lg-4 d-none d-lg-block\"><div style=\"position:sticky;top:2rem\"><div class=\"acpwb-card mb-3\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:.7rem\">Meeting Record</div><dl class=\"mb-0\" style=\"font-size:.82rem\"><dt style=\"opacity:.55;font-size:.68rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em\">Meeting Ref</dt><dd class=\"mb-2\" style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:.75rem;opacity:.7\">MIN-2015-07-7075</dd><dt style=\"opacity:.55;font-size:.68rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spac